ecursing otherwise.\n- queryCount(u, depth, L, R, ql, qr) to count distinct values in a query range.\nThe solution uses up to about a few million nodes in the worst case (manageable within memory limits), and depth is only 20, so recursion is safe.\n\nThis approach handles the constraints: n up to 2e5, q up to 1e5, values in [0, 2^20).",
